docs {
  Registration update should capture core college details and college-level tab setup only.

  Registration tabs list (college section):
  - student_code_of_conduct
  - happenings
  - institutions_across_world
  - commute
  - college_overview

  Use campuses endpoints to create and manage campuses.
  Use courses endpoints to create courses and course tabs.

  Dynamic fetch notes for registration sections:
  - `commute` in GET /api/v1/college-admin/profile/sections is sourced from
    GET /api/v1/college-admin/commute.
  - `institutions_across_world` in GET /api/v1/college-admin/profile/sections
    is sourced from institution group membership data.
}
